    <bpmn:process id="W_W3801" name="W3801. Import Order Consolidation, Container Planning &amp; Consolidated Buying" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sourcing plan (W3785); buying cycle
Frequency: Per buying cycle (continuous)
Volume: ~400–600 TEUs/month
Owner: Global Sourcing / Supply Planning
Participants: Global Sourcing, Supply Planning (links to VS-02), Buyers (links to VS-01), Freight (links to VS-110), Logistics Finance (links to W3788), DC Ops (links to VS-04)
Source: workflow W3801 — Import Order Consolidation, Container Planning &amp; Consolidated Buying</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3801_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3801_Lane1" name="Global Sourcing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3801_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3801_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3801_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3801_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3801_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3801_Start3" name="Sourcing plan (W3785); buying cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3801_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3801_Task4" name="Global Sourcing/Supply-Planning plan consolidated import container buying…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Global Sourcing/Supply-Planning plan consolidated import container buying: aggregate category/entity demand into container-load POs, sequence vendor POs by origin/port/lead time to fill containers and reduce partial-load (LCL) cost, and balance against demand/lead time (links to VS-02.1)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3801_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3801_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3801_Task5" name="Global Sourcing/Buyers place consolidated import POs (links to VS-02.2/W2B)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Global Sourcing/Buyers place consolidated import POs (links to VS-02.2/W2B): multi-vendor/multi-category consolidation at origin, container booking, and origin consolidation-point coordination (agent/office links to W3793/W3794)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Buyers / Freight
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3801_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3801_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3801_Task6" name="Global Sourcing/Freight optimize container utilization (cube/weight) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Global Sourcing/Freight optimize container utilization (cube/weight) and routing (links to W3803), and track container fill-rate / consolidation savings (links to W3807)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Freight / Logistics Finance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3801_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3801_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3801_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3801_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-597 (ensure controlled execution — Import Sourcing Performance, Consolidation &amp; Total-Landed-Cost Analytics (PA-122.3).) | - operational: container planning; operational: demand/service-level balance
Owner: Global Sourcing / Supply Planning</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
