    <bpmn:process id="W_W3802" name="W3802. Multi-Vendor / Multi-Category Container &amp; LCL Consolidation Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Container plan (W3801); LCL need
Frequency: Per shipment
Volume: Multi-origin consolidation
Owner: Global Sourcing / Freight
Participants: Global Sourcing, Freight (links to VS-110), Agent/Office (links to W3793/W3794), Customs (links to VS-87), Quality (links to VS-31), DC Ops (links to VS-04), Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03)
Source: workflow W3802 — Multi-Vendor / Multi-Category Container &amp; LCL Consolidation Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3802_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3802_Lane1" name="Global Sourcing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3802_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3802_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3802_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3802_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3802_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3802_Start3" name="Container plan (W3801); LCL need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3802_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3802_Task4" name="Global Sourcing/Agent/Office execute origin consolidation: coordinate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Global Sourcing/Agent/Office execute origin consolidation: coordinate multi-vendor/multi-category POs to a consolidation point (CFS/warehouse), consolidate into FCL where economic or ship LCL, and manage origin documentation/packing/list (links to VS-87)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Agent / Freight
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3802_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3802_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3802_Task5" name="Global Sourcing/Quality run origin pre-shipment inspection of consolidated…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Global Sourcing/Quality run origin pre-shipment inspection of consolidated loads (links to W1613/W3798) so defective goods are caught before ocean transit
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Quality / Agent
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3802_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3802_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3802_Task6" name="Global Sourcing/Freight/Customs manage consolidated-container documentation and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Global Sourcing/Freight/Customs manage consolidated-container documentation and handoff to carrier/broker (links to VS-02.2/VS-87/VS-110), and reconcile multi-vendor contents at receiving (links to VS-04)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Freight / Customs
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3802_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3802_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3802_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3802_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-597 (ensure controlled execution — Import Sourcing Performance, Consolidation &amp; Total-Landed-Cost Analytics (PA-122.3).) | - operational: packing-list control and origin inspection; operational: consolidation scheduling and vendor performance (links to W3805)
Owner: Global Sourcing / Freight</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
