    <bpmn:process id="W_W3803" name="W3803. Freight &amp; Route Optimization for Import Sourcing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sourcing plan (W3785); freight contract cycle (links to VS-110)
Frequency: Per routing decision + ongoing
Volume: Import freight routing portfolio
Owner: Global Sourcing / Freight
Participants: Global Sourcing, Freight (links to VS-110), Supply Planning (links to VS-02), Logistics Finance (links to W3788), Customs (links to VS-87), Treasury (links to VS-18)
Source: workflow W3803 — Freight &amp; Route Optimization for Import Sourcing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3803_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3803_Lane1" name="Global Sourcing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3803_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3803_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3803_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3803_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3803_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3803_Start3" name="Sourcing plan (W3785); freight contract cycle (links to VS-110)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3803_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3803_Task4" name="Global Sourcing/Freight optimize import freight routing: carrier/route/port…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Global Sourcing/Freight optimize import freight routing: carrier/route/port selection (origin port → PH port), FCL vs LCL, transshipment vs direct, and final-leg to DC, in coordination with the freight-procurement program (links to VS-110.1) and landed-cost framework (links to W3788)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Freight
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3803_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3803_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3803_Task5" name="Global Sourcing/Freight manage freight-cost components and surcharges (BAF/CAF…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Global Sourcing/Freight manage freight-cost components and surcharges (BAF/CAF, low-sulfur, congestion, demurrage/detention links to VS-02.2/W249), and negotiate carrier contracts for import lanes (links to VS-110.1)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Freight / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3803_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3803_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3803_Task6" name="Global Sourcing/Finance publish import-freight cost analytics (cost/TEU…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Global Sourcing/Finance publish import-freight cost analytics (cost/TEU, cost/cbm, lane benchmark, demurrage exposure) and recommend routing/carrier optimization (links to W3807/VS-110)
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3803_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3803_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3803_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
