    <bpmn:process id="W_W3804" name="W3804. Import Sourcing Cycle-Time, Lead-Time &amp; Flow Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Planning cycle; lead-time degradation
Frequency: Quarterly + ongoing
Volume: Import lead-time portfolio (45–90 days)
Owner: Global Sourcing / Supply Planning
Participants: Global Sourcing, Supply Planning (links to VS-02), Merchandising (links to VS-01), DC Ops (links to VS-04), Quality (links to VS-31), Freight (links to VS-110)
Source: workflow W3804 — Import Sourcing Cycle-Time, Lead-Time &amp; Flow Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3804_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3804_Lane1" name="Global Sourcing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3804_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3804_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3804_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3804_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3804_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3804_Start3" name="Planning cycle; lead-time degradation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3804_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3804_Task4" name="Global Sourcing/Supply-Planning manage import sourcing cycle time and lead…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Global Sourcing/Supply-Planning manage import sourcing cycle time and lead time: order-to-receipt lead time by vendor/country/route (PO → production → origin consolidation → ocean → customs → DC), set planning lead times in the system (links to VS-02.1), and identify lead-time reduction opportunities
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3804_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3804_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3804_Task5" name="Global Sourcing manage in-transit visibility and flow (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Global Sourcing manage in-transit visibility and flow (links to VS-02.2/VS-110.2): container tracking, milestone monitoring, exception management, and DC receiving synchronization
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Freight / DC Ops
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3804_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3804_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
