      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporting cycle; sourcing decision
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly
Volume: Enterprise import landed-cost analytics
Owner: Global Sourcing / Logistics Finance
Participants: Global Sourcing, Logistics Finance (links to VS-17.4/VS-106), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Freight (links to VS-110), Customs (links to VS-87), Treasury (links to VS-18), Merchandise Finance (links to VS-101)
