    <bpmn:process id="W_W3808" name="W3808. Global Sourcing Executive Review &amp; Strategic Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Executive cycle (links to VS-33.2); board reporting (links to VS-36)
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Enterprise global-sourcing strategic review
Owner: Global Sourcing / VP Merchandising
Participants: Global Sourcing, VP Merchandising, Finance (links to VS-17.4), Strategy (links to VS-33), Risk (links to VS-21.2), Compliance (links to VS-22/VS-87), ESG (links to VS-25), Analytics (links to VS-28.1), Executive (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W3808 — Global Sourcing Executive Review &amp; Strategic Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3808_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3808_Lane1" name="Global Sourcing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3808_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3808_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3808_Lane2" name="VP Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3808_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3808_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3808_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3808_Start4" name="Executive cycle (links to VS-33.2); board reporting (links to VS-36)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3808_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3808_Task5" name="Global Sourcing/VP-Merchandising compile the global-sourcing strategic review…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Global Sourcing/VP-Merchandising compile the global-sourcing strategic review: import mix and spend, TLC trend and savings realized (links to W3807), vendor/agent/office performance (links to W3805/W3806), source-market and risk posture (links to W3786/W3790), compliance and ESG posture (links to W3798/W3792), and model-portfolio economics
Responsible (R): Global Sourcing / Finance / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3808_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3808_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3808_Task6" name="VP Merchandising/Strategy translate review into strategic sourcing decisions…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: VP Merchandising/Strategy translate review into strategic sourcing decisions: source-market shifts, model migrations, vendor consolidation/development, and investment in agent/office capability — aligned to corporate strategy (links to VS-33) and merchandise plan (links to VS-101)
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising / Strategy
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3808_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3808_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3808_Task7" name="VP Merchandising report global-sourcing posture and risks to the executive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Merchandising report global-sourcing posture and risks to the executive committee and board (links to VS-36/VS-33.2), including supply-base geographic risk and resilience (links to W3790) and ESG/responsible-sourcing (links to VS-25)
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Quarterly/annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3808_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3808_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3808_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3808_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-597 (ensure controlled execution — Import Sourcing Performance, Consolidation &amp; Total-Landed-Cost Analytics (PA-122.3).) | - operational: strategic review and linkage; operational: board reporting
Owner: Global Sourcing / VP Merchandising</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
